---
import EditorialLayout from '../layouts/EditorialLayout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/paths';
---
<EditorialLayout title="The 2046 Mission - 46K" description="What would it take for Sweden to win the World Cup in 2046? A direction for research and development.">
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-intro container"><p class="kicker">THE FOUNDING QUESTION</p><span class="line"></span><h1 class="serif mission-title">Sweden.<br />World Champions.<br />2046.</h1><p class="page-deck">2046 is not a prediction. It is a direction.</p></section>
    <section class="mission-band"><div class="container two-column"><h2 class="serif">An unreasonable<br />ambition.</h2><div class="prose"><p>What would it take for Sweden to win the World Cup in 2046?</p><p>We use that question to look at how football understands and develops talent. What can cognitive science contribute? What are we missing when we focus only on what is visible today?</p><p>The ambition sets a direction. The work is to ask useful questions, test our assumptions and stay honest about what the evidence supports.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('explore/?category=2046')}>Read the 2046 perspective <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="page-close container"><p class="kicker">UNDERSTAND / ASSESS / DEVELOP</p><h2 class="serif">A longer view of talent.</h2><a class="button-link" href={sitePath('explore/')}>Explore our thinking <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></section>
  </main>
</EditorialLayout>
